  "prompt": "For each channel, how many registered customers placed their latest 2025 order through it? 2025 means order_ts, a UTC moment, from 1 January 2025 up to but not including 1 January 2026, and guest orders have a missing customer_id and do not count. A customer's latest order is the one with the latest order_ts; when a customer's two latest orders tie on order_ts, the one with the lower order_id counts as the latest. Return two columns, in this order: channel and customers. Return one row for each channel. Any row order is fine.",
